## Third-party material

### KBLI 2020 classification data

`nata_agent/statutes/kbli/kbli-2020-5digit.json`

Contains 1,790 five-digit KBLI codes with their official titles and
descriptions. KBLI (Klasifikasi Baku Lapangan Usaha Indonesia) is the official
industrial classification of **Badan Pusat Statistik (BPS)**, Republic of
Indonesia, published under Peraturan BPS No. 2 Tahun 2020.

The codes and titles are factual government data. This repository does not
claim copyright over them, and the Apache-2.0 grant above does not extend to
them. The extraction path used for this prototype is documented in
`docs/regulasi-provenance.md`, including its known limitation: the public
mirror it was taken from carries no explicit licence, and the dataset should be
re-sourced from BPS or OSS-RBA before redistribution beyond this prototype.

### PP 55/2022 statute text

`nata_agent/statutes/pp-55-2022-pph-final-umkm.md`

A transcription of selected articles from Peraturan Pemerintah No. 55 Tahun
2022 (Indonesian government regulation on the final income tax for micro, small
and medium enterprises). Indonesian legislation is publicly promulgated and is
not subject to copyright as a legislative text. The transcription is included
as a citation corpus so that every tax figure the application reports can be
verified against its source; it is not claimed as original work.

